WEBVTT

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:03.903
Let's take stock of our situation.

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:07.838
Our ship, the Mesopotamia,
had some sort of an accident.

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:11.070
At that time, the shuttle was released,
and we crash-landed on this planet.

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:14.045
And, we six are the only survivors.

00:00:14.314 --> 00:00:16.544
What can six people do?!

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:20.485
And we're all male!
We can't have any children!

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:23.488
That means, it all ends
with our generation.

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:24.955
If we have no females...

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:27.460
...we can supplement
our numbers with clones.

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:28.788
Faust?!

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:30.887
We should be able to create humans
with different characteristics...

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:33.456
...and personalities through
genetic manipulation.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:34.758
But, that's like...

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:37.565
"Like playing God," leyasu?

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:40.607
What can six people hope to do
on a backlands planet like this?

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:42.869
Yeah! Faust is right!

00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:46.003
Something could happen
to any of us at any time!

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:48.605
We need a population big
enough to claim this planet.

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:50.850
Hey... He's absolutely right!

00:01:15.108 --> 00:01:18.339
| came to this land to protect you.

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:21.908
| was born to be with you.

00:01:22.282 --> 00:01:25.252
The moment I awoke...

00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:29.379
...prisms surrounded me.

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:32.924
I'm here to love you now.

00:01:33.126 --> 00:01:36.619
I was born to hold you.

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:39.800
Lies and truths...

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:43.927
...are all within ourselves.

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:48.707
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:01:49.075 --> 00:01:50.543
...won't get to me.

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:53.936
Tenderness and caring...

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:57.610
...can be ours once again!

00:01:57.984 --> 00:02:02.217
Day in, day out,
like a puppet on a string.

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:06.054
Wandering in the void
between zero and infinity.

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:09.460
The strength to sever
the tangled wires...

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:14.228
...is still sleeping inside of you.

00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:26.043
In the distant future,
at the edge of the universe...

00:02:26.112 --> 00:02:27.739
...was a planet called "Terra I."

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:30.840
It was a planet with no human
females, inhabited only by men.

00:02:31.417 --> 00:02:35.911
In the 300th year of Terra Il history,
humans raised clones for offspring...

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:39.926
...and formed six city-states.
In one of the states...

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:44.521
...a young Japoness boy named Otaru
somehow awakened Lime and Cherry...

00:02:44.597 --> 00:02:46.793
...two "marionettes”
that possessed emotion.

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:50.162
The mystery behind Terra ll
and the marionettes...

00:02:50.236 --> 00:02:52.603
...is about to be exposed!

00:02:53.406 --> 00:03:01.406
Challenge from Faust

00:03:13.359 --> 00:03:15.521
Hmm... Two marionettes in Japoness...

00:03:15.595 --> 00:03:18.428
...that can fight on an equal
standing with Panther...?

00:03:19.933 --> 00:03:21.992
I doubt those
are ordinary sabers.

00:03:22.535 --> 00:03:25.129
It would be amusing
to go and see them.

00:03:25.939 --> 00:03:27.930
You yourself, Lord Faust?

00:03:28.007 --> 00:03:30.738
Please wait, Lord!
Leave the reconnaissance to us!

00:03:31.477 --> 00:03:33.377
You dare tell me what to do?

00:03:33.947 --> 00:03:35.437
Please forgive me!

00:03:35.515 --> 00:03:37.347
Oh, never mind. Go get ready"

00:03:37.417 --> 00:03:38.885
Sir!

00:03:51.698 --> 00:03:53.325
"DEATHBLOW"

00:03:55.768 --> 00:03:58.863
What's wrong, Otaru?
You seem to be out of shape.

00:03:59.005 --> 00:04:02.441
Each day of practice missed
requires three days to regain.

00:04:02.508 --> 00:04:05.603
Only untiring daily discipline
will produce results. Now, come!

00:04:11.684 --> 00:04:13.243
Ow!

00:04:13.319 --> 00:04:16.949
Go, Otaru, go!
Kick that old guy's butt!

00:04:17.323 --> 00:04:19.223
Try to keep your
voice down, Lime.

00:04:19.292 --> 00:04:20.851
0-Okay.

00:04:20.927 --> 00:04:23.294
There! Get 'im there!

00:04:28.901 --> 00:04:30.369
LOOK ouT!

00:04:35.008 --> 00:04:37.943
His feet, his feet! Otaru!
Kick his feet!

00:04:39.279 --> 00:04:41.179
There! Get 'im!

00:04:44.584 --> 00:04:46.780
- Otaru!
- Come on, Master Otaru!

00:04:49.222 --> 00:04:50.883
- GO
- Master Otaru!!

00:04:53.626 --> 00:04:55.219
You lack concentration, Otaru!

00:04:55.295 --> 00:04:57.320
You dare look elsewhere
during practice?!

00:05:02.735 --> 00:05:04.703
- Otaru!
- Oh, no!

00:05:06.472 --> 00:05:08.236
Are you all right,
Master Otaru?!

00:05:08.474 --> 00:05:10.499
You jerk! What are
you doing to my Otaru?!

00:05:10.576 --> 00:05:12.738
- I'll take you on!
- Now, now...

00:05:12.812 --> 00:05:15.144
You! You! You!
How dare you!

00:05:16.316 --> 00:05:17.841
Enough.

00:05:17.917 --> 00:05:20.443
My fists were not made
to hit marionettes...

00:05:28.194 --> 00:05:29.821
Master! Master Obiichi!

00:05:29.896 --> 00:05:31.887
- Look what she did to our teacher!
- What's the big idea?!

00:05:32.999 --> 00:05:35.969
Okay, now I get to practice!

00:05:43.976 --> 00:05:45.944
Why does this happen to me?

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:53.420
You! You! Take that!

00:05:55.955 --> 00:05:59.220
Otaru...? What the heck
is with your marionettes?!

00:05:59.692 --> 00:06:02.184
Are their conscience
circuits fried?!

00:06:02.562 --> 00:06:05.429
How rude. Our circuits
are not fried!

00:06:11.637 --> 00:06:12.798
The Guards of the Imperial Court!

00:06:12.872 --> 00:06:14.499
It's the Imperial sabers!

00:06:14.674 --> 00:06:17.541
Mr. Otaru Mamiya,
the Shogun has summoned you.

00:06:17.777 --> 00:06:19.006
M-Me?

00:06:19.479 --> 00:06:22.005
He asks that you bring
Lime and Cherry with you.

00:06:34.494 --> 00:06:37.464
"Learn From The Past"
"Take Life Easy"

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:52.106
Lime!

00:06:52.178 --> 00:06:54.169
What are you doing? C'mon!

00:06:54.247 --> 00:06:55.715
Coming!

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:59.851
Soon. Very soon now.

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:04.352
Shogun, we have brought
Mr. Otaru Mamiya.

00:07:08.027 --> 00:07:09.722
Very good!

00:07:09.929 --> 00:07:11.419
Wow!

00:07:11.497 --> 00:07:13.431
Hey, hey! Can I lookit this?

00:07:13.499 --> 00:07:15.763
Hey! Don't touch anything
without permission!

00:07:16.636 --> 00:07:18.104
Let them, let them!

00:07:22.875 --> 00:07:26.368
Uh... Shogun?
What can I do for you?

00:07:26.446 --> 00:07:28.380
Oh, yes! I clean forgot.

00:07:28.448 --> 00:07:31.884
Well, then. Let's sit down
and discuss this over tea.

00:07:32.885 --> 00:07:33.511
Yessir.

00:07:35.655 --> 00:07:38.625
- Okay, here it comes!
- Hey, don't do that!

00:07:39.692 --> 00:07:40.955
STOP THAT!

00:07:41.027 --> 00:07:43.291
How are things going with them?

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:45.823
Pardon?

00:07:45.898 --> 00:07:47.866
Your tea, sir.

00:07:49.969 --> 00:07:51.801
Don't move! Come back here!
Come back, I say!

00:07:51.871 --> 00:07:52.838
Thank you!

00:07:52.905 --> 00:07:54.873
Excuse me, sir.

00:07:56.175 --> 00:07:58.109
What do you think
when you look at them?

00:07:58.945 --> 00:08:00.242
Lime and Cherry.

00:08:00.313 --> 00:08:02.680
Don't you find them different
from other marionettes?

00:08:02.849 --> 00:08:05.716
Well... It's hard to
put it into words, but...

00:08:05.785 --> 00:08:10.552
...Lime and Cherry are both so human,
that they might as well BE human.

00:08:10.923 --> 00:08:13.893
Those two are special marionettes.

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:15.394
Special?

00:08:15.461 --> 00:08:17.395
In order to explain it properly...

00:08:17.463 --> 00:08:20.524
...you must first know
the history of Terra ll.

00:08:21.901 --> 00:08:24.768
Otaru, did you regularly
attend elementary school?

00:08:24.837 --> 00:08:27.738
R-Regularly? Well, actually...

00:08:30.476 --> 00:08:33.070
I..well, uh...

00:08:33.279 --> 00:08:35.441
All right then,
I'll make it simple.

00:08:36.482 --> 00:08:39.417
When Earth was in
its 22nd century...

00:08:39.485 --> 00:08:42.352
...as a measure to combat over-
population, a project was announced...

00:08:42.421 --> 00:08:46.722
...to colonize outer space, and open
up the universe for settlement.

00:08:46.792 --> 00:08:49.727
It was 300 years ago that
one of those transport ships...

00:08:49.795 --> 00:08:54.198
...the Mesopotamia, arrived
at this planet, "Terra IL.”

00:08:54.867 --> 00:08:59.236
However, only six survived,
and all six were men.

00:09:00.873 --> 00:09:05.367
We six will have to make this
land liveable by ourselves.

00:09:05.912 --> 00:09:08.210
But what can six people do?!

00:09:08.281 --> 00:09:11.842
And we're all male!
We can't have any children!

00:09:11.918 --> 00:09:14.888
That means, it all ends
with our generation.

00:09:15.054 --> 00:09:18.888
Then we can supplement our
numbers with clones of ourselves.

00:09:19.158 --> 00:09:21.889
Men can't make children
amongst themselves.

00:09:21.961 --> 00:09:23.793
We were facing extinction.

00:09:23.863 --> 00:09:26.423
So, the six men had no choice
but to create offspring...

00:09:26.499 --> 00:09:29.264
...through genetic manipulation
and cloning technology.

00:09:29.335 --> 00:09:30.928
And now, 300 years later...

00:09:31.003 --> 00:09:33.438
...each person living in each
of the six city-states...

00:09:33.506 --> 00:09:36.373
...is the progeny of
those first six men.

00:09:36.943 --> 00:09:38.843
But as you already know...

00:09:38.911 --> 00:09:42.404
...all of the citizens in
all six cities are male.

00:09:42.915 --> 00:09:45.714
This is because even most
skillful genetic manipulation...

00:09:45.785 --> 00:09:47.753
...was unable to produce a female.

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:51.117
That was when the first six
created an android...

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:54.751
...in the shape of a woman.
A "marionette.”

00:09:54.827 --> 00:09:56.921
So, what makes Lime
and Cherry special?

00:09:57.129 --> 00:09:59.097
Take it easy there, boy...

00:10:00.333 --> 00:10:03.769
Otaru, have you seen
other marionettes laugh...

00:10:03.836 --> 00:10:07.238
...or become sad or angry
like those two do?

00:10:11.811 --> 00:10:14.872
You haven't, have you?
Marionettes are, after all, machines.

00:10:14.947 --> 00:10:16.847
They don't have souls.

00:10:16.916 --> 00:10:19.351
But then, what about
Lime and Cherry?

00:10:19.418 --> 00:10:21.910
They each possess
a "maiden circuit."

00:10:23.456 --> 00:10:24.821
MAIDEN CIRCUIT?!

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:26.324
To put it simply...

00:10:26.392 --> 00:10:29.760
...it's a circuit that
produces and controls emotion.

00:10:29.829 --> 00:10:32.127
The technology has
since been lost.

00:10:32.198 --> 00:10:33.222
What?!

00:10:33.299 --> 00:10:34.528
Lime! Cherry!

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:35.863
Yes?

00:10:35.935 --> 00:10:37.164
What is it, Grampa?

00:10:37.236 --> 00:10:39.728
Do you like Otaru?

00:10:39.805 --> 00:10:42.365
I love Otaru!
Otaruis MY Otaru!

00:10:42.441 --> 00:10:46.639
That's not funny! Master
Otaru is very dear to ME!

00:10:46.846 --> 00:10:50.544
Grr! Grr! Grr! Grr!

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:53.211
Now do you see, Otaru?

00:10:53.285 --> 00:10:57.244
You have been chosen by two
marionettes with maiden circuits.

00:10:57.323 --> 00:10:59.724
Chosen? What do
you mean, "chosen"?

00:11:00.192 --> 00:11:02.923
SHOGUN!

00:11:03.462 --> 00:11:05.624
It's a dire emergency!

00:11:05.698 --> 00:11:07.689
- What's the meaning of this?!
-It's.. It's...!

00:11:11.103 --> 00:11:13.003
What? What's going on?

00:11:25.718 --> 00:11:27.686
That's a Gartlant sub!

00:12:11.664 --> 00:12:14.690
It appears Panther was impolite
to you the other day.

00:12:15.201 --> 00:12:19.138
| see why your marionette
knows no manners.

00:12:19.638 --> 00:12:21.868
She takes after her master.

00:12:22.641 --> 00:12:26.578
Faust, boots are not to
be worn on top of tatami.

00:12:29.148 --> 00:12:32.345
Do you plan to crush Peterburg
with those very boots?

00:12:32.418 --> 00:12:34.546
Haven't you given a thought
as to the anxiety...

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:36.748
...your actions are spreading
across Terra ll?

00:12:37.389 --> 00:12:40.120
Call back your troops
surrounding Peterburg immediately!

00:12:40.426 --> 00:12:42.485
You haven't changed a bit, leyasu.

00:12:42.628 --> 00:12:47.395
That's Faust? The fuhrer of Gartlant?
Look at the smirk on his face!

00:12:47.466 --> 00:12:50.925
Hey! That's the one
that picked on you! Grr!

00:12:51.103 --> 00:12:53.128
I hear you have two marionettes
that can fight...

00:12:53.205 --> 00:12:55.173
...on an equal footing
with Panther here.

00:12:56.509 --> 00:12:59.672
Those two marionettes have
maiden circuits, don't they?

00:13:01.413 --> 00:13:03.177
Like these three do!

00:13:03.449 --> 00:13:05.417
They have maiden circuits too?!

00:13:13.959 --> 00:13:17.395
Would I be able to meet
the two marionettes?

00:13:17.897 --> 00:13:19.626
"Meet"?

00:13:19.698 --> 00:13:24.067
I thought your custom was to throw
punches without shaking hands first.

00:13:25.671 --> 00:13:28.470
Faust... Why do you
prefer to fight?

00:13:28.541 --> 00:13:31.533
Why are you trying
to create a war?!

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:35.308
Who is the best amongst we six?

00:13:38.384 --> 00:13:40.352
Man has evolved war
into the rite of passage...

00:13:40.419 --> 00:13:43.047
...that decides who the
most superior being is.

00:13:43.589 --> 00:13:45.523
The inhabitants of this
planet are nothing more...

00:13:45.591 --> 00:13:48.356
...than copies of the first six.
As long as we are copies...

00:13:48.427 --> 00:13:50.691
...we should use the best copy.

00:13:51.964 --> 00:13:56.526
These uncultured persons
have no real merit in living.

00:13:58.737 --> 00:14:00.330
What tripe.

00:14:00.406 --> 00:14:01.373
What?!

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:05.035
Faust, the humans on this planet
have outdistanced the first six...

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:09.445
...and have evolved personalities
and characteristics of their own.

00:14:09.982 --> 00:14:11.950
One cannot judge
the value of others...

00:14:12.017 --> 00:14:15.146
...soley upon their level of
intelligence and power of memory!

00:14:17.923 --> 00:14:20.688
In this world, people are being
born with wonderful abilities...

00:14:20.759 --> 00:14:23.490
...the likes of which
you couldn't begin to imagine.

00:14:23.562 --> 00:14:26.224
Ha! Now it is YOU talking tripe.

00:14:26.432 --> 00:14:28.662
Copies are nothing
more than copies!

00:14:28.834 --> 00:14:31.201
There are those with a
state of consciousness...

00:14:31.270 --> 00:14:34.035
...that enables them to treat
marionettes as equals!

00:14:35.474 --> 00:14:38.068
Master Otaru! I'm registering
an explosive device!

00:14:38.143 --> 00:14:38.701
What?!

00:14:38.777 --> 00:14:42.441
I'm absolutely certain.
This Faust is a dummy android.

00:14:42.514 --> 00:14:44.642
I'm registering the explosives
from inside of him!

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:51.617
Shogun!! He's got
a bomb inside him!!

00:15:01.066 --> 00:15:02.534
Good God!

00:15:03.569 --> 00:15:05.230
Master Otaru!

00:15:13.879 --> 00:15:15.347
Prepare to die, leyasu!

00:15:21.654 --> 00:15:23.122
Shogun!

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:33.298
What're you doing?!

00:15:34.433 --> 00:15:36.197
Break, dammit! Break, break!!

00:15:36.936 --> 00:15:38.802
You'll have to do
better than that!

00:15:55.988 --> 00:15:58.548
| see. So that's
what you would do.

00:15:59.892 --> 00:16:03.590
Hmm... I see you have the same
battlefield sensor as I do.

00:16:04.296 --> 00:16:06.731
Your computational abilities
aren't bad either.

00:16:07.366 --> 00:16:08.925
And vice-versa!

00:16:09.401 --> 00:16:10.835
Lime! Cherry!

00:16:10.903 --> 00:16:11.927
Otaru...

00:16:12.004 --> 00:16:14.132
Hush, Shogun! You mustn't talk!

00:16:14.206 --> 00:16:18.143
The statue... Press the switch
on the Deva statue...

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:19.371
What?!

00:16:19.445 --> 00:16:23.279
Hurry! The third...
The third...

00:16:24.383 --> 00:16:25.851
Shogun!!

00:16:26.485 --> 00:16:28.078
He's only unconscious.

00:16:28.153 --> 00:16:29.621
Thank God!

00:16:29.688 --> 00:16:32.680
Mr. Otaru, you must do
as the Shogun instructed!

00:16:37.363 --> 00:16:39.331
Take the Shogun to the infirmary!

00:16:49.842 --> 00:16:51.810
You've given me a lot of trouble!

00:16:53.379 --> 00:16:57.873
Watch out. You'd better not
look away, or you might die.

00:17:00.252 --> 00:17:02.050
Where?! Where is it?!

00:17:03.822 --> 00:17:05.290
Here it is!

00:17:13.298 --> 00:17:14.857
What's causing this vibration?!

00:17:31.817 --> 00:17:33.876
Hey, brat!
Don't be such a bad loser!

00:17:35.554 --> 00:17:37.022
What?

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:42.455
Master Otaru!!

00:17:42.928 --> 00:17:45.260
Hey! Otaru's having all the fun!

00:18:01.880 --> 00:18:03.848
| was wondering what that was!

00:18:14.593 --> 00:18:16.220
What is that?!

00:18:19.798 --> 00:18:22.426
Her combat capabilities...
...are off the scale!

00:18:22.501 --> 00:18:23.559
Say what?

00:18:23.635 --> 00:18:25.694
That's impossible!

00:18:31.376 --> 00:18:33.344
What is this POWER?!

00:18:56.368 --> 00:18:59.338
Oh, please! You people
haven't got a clue!

00:19:04.543 --> 00:19:08.377
I have a short temper!
Let's get this over with!

00:19:08.447 --> 00:19:11.940
Tiger! Panther!
We have to regroup!

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:16.617
Come back here!!

00:19:17.856 --> 00:19:19.415
They're gone!

00:19:20.959 --> 00:19:22.427
They went above!

00:19:24.363 --> 00:19:26.457
What the hell IS that saber?!

00:19:26.532 --> 00:19:27.556
What now, Luchs?

00:19:27.633 --> 00:19:29.533
Her combat capability
may be incalculable...

00:19:29.601 --> 00:19:32.263
...but her energy
has to have a limit.

00:19:32.337 --> 00:19:34.499
So, if we take her
three on one, maybe...

00:19:38.744 --> 00:19:40.269
You WON'T get away!

00:19:40.345 --> 00:19:41.210
You...!

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:44.272
I don't have enough data.
We'll have to withdraw for now!

00:19:44.349 --> 00:19:45.578
There's no other choice!

00:19:46.485 --> 00:19:49.887
Hey, hey, hey! I said
yer not gettin' away!!

00:20:03.869 --> 00:20:05.837
They're quick on their feet.

00:20:09.007 --> 00:20:10.270
Otaru!

00:20:10.342 --> 00:20:13.471
Are you all right, Master Otaru?
Does your bottom hurt at all?

00:20:13.545 --> 00:20:15.013
Nah, it's nothing!

00:20:20.052 --> 00:20:22.248
You're the one who
woke me, aren't you?

00:20:22.321 --> 00:20:23.516
Uh... I.

00:20:23.589 --> 00:20:26.251
I'm Bloodberry. You are...?

00:20:26.325 --> 00:20:29.056
I... 'm Otaru. Otaru Mamiya.

00:20:29.228 --> 00:20:30.855
| see. Otaru, hm?

00:20:30.929 --> 00:20:32.988
I'm glad to be on your side, Otaru.

00:20:36.335 --> 00:20:38.326
H-Hey!! What do you
think you're doing?!

00:20:38.403 --> 00:20:40.235
I'm saying hello, of course.

00:20:40.305 --> 00:20:42.774
Is that how you say hello
to someone you've never met?!

00:20:42.841 --> 00:20:46.778
A peck on the cheek is normal enough.
Next time, I'll go to step two.

00:20:46.845 --> 00:20:49.075
S-S-STEP TWO?!

00:20:49.147 --> 00:20:51.206
I'm going to peck Otaru, too!

00:20:51.283 --> 00:20:52.409
LIME

00:20:52.484 --> 00:20:53.508
Pe---ck!

00:20:53.719 --> 00:20:56.086
Lemme go!! Whatcha doing?!
| wanna peck, too!

00:20:56.154 --> 00:20:57.315
Here.

00:20:57.389 --> 00:20:59.824
This is neither the time
nor place for little children.

00:20:59.891 --> 00:21:01.256
Pardon me?!

00:21:01.326 --> 00:21:02.259
Wanna make something of it?

00:21:02.327 --> 00:21:03.795
Don't be a greedy pig!

00:21:06.398 --> 00:21:09.333
There's THREE marionettes
with maiden circuits!

00:21:09.401 --> 00:21:11.369
What's going to happen now?

00:21:13.905 --> 00:21:16.931
I'm sorry, Lord! We'll formulate
a new plan and take Japoness--

00:21:17.009 --> 00:21:18.067
Leave them.

00:21:18.143 --> 00:21:19.235
Sir?

00:21:19.311 --> 00:21:22.747
Japoness is of no consequence.
| can squash them at any time.

00:21:22.814 --> 00:21:24.826
You have other tasks at hand!

00:21:24.850 --> 00:21:26.818
- Understood.
- Leave me.

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:30.445
You've assembled
your pawns, leyasu...

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:33.358
Hess?

00:21:34.393 --> 00:21:38.694
Did that happen unexpectedly--
Or rather, as you expected?

00:21:39.031 --> 00:21:43.969
What are you referring to? I'm merely
giving Peterburg top priority.

00:21:44.469 --> 00:21:46.494
But never mind that.
How is it?

00:21:46.571 --> 00:21:47.936
Don't worry.

00:21:48.006 --> 00:21:51.203
I believe I will be able to
present it to you very soon.

00:22:14.833 --> 00:22:18.428
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:22:18.637 --> 00:22:22.301
...don't go off to be alone.

00:22:22.441 --> 00:22:25.240
Just think of me...

00:22:25.444 --> 00:22:29.972
...and I'll be there with you.

00:22:30.248 --> 00:22:33.980
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:34.052 --> 00:22:37.716
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:37.889 --> 00:22:41.621
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:41.693 --> 00:22:43.388
...with a dried-up heart.

00:22:43.462 --> 00:22:47.456
You can't feel a thing.

00:22:49.568 --> 00:22:51.935
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:22:52.003 --> 00:22:56.941
...what they really feel inside?

00:22:57.109 --> 00:23:00.773
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:23:00.979 --> 00:23:04.574
...one step at a time.

00:23:04.783 --> 00:23:08.481
I love the way you don't care...

00:23:08.553 --> 00:23:12.285
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:23:12.424 --> 00:23:15.985
| would follow you anywhere.

00:23:16.361 --> 00:23:22.323
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:31.476 --> 00:23:33.274
Yoo-hoo! It's me, Lime!

00:23:33.345 --> 00:23:35.871
Bloodberry has launched
an all-out love war!

00:23:35.947 --> 00:23:38.439
Otaru is dying,
and we're ticked off!

00:23:38.517 --> 00:23:40.884
What? The flying machine that
Otaru and Bloodberry were on...

00:23:40.952 --> 00:23:42.818
...has gone missing?!

00:23:42.888 --> 00:23:45.357
Oh, no! They're on
a devil mountain...

00:23:45.424 --> 00:23:47.950
...crawling with terrible
wild beasts and stuff!

00:23:48.493 --> 00:23:53.975
Passionate Unwelcoming! Flying
Love Attack! Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:23:53.999 --> 00:23:56.127
Passionate Unwelcoming! Flying
Love Attack! I love you, Otaru!
